title Trends & Insights - Artifact Production Flow (Flat 2-Level)

| Campaign Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
| LLM Agents |
| SDK Calls (Deterministic) |
| Storage (GCS) |

| Campaign Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
start
:Initialize Session;

:TRENDS: Query BigQuery + YouTube API;
| Storage (GCS) |
:Save Trends Metadata (state_delta);

| LLM Agents |
:research_agent: google_search + recall_prior_insights;
:Compose cited research report;
| Campaign Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
:Capture report via _run_agent_and_capture;

| LLM Agents |
:ad_creative_agent: Draft/critique/select;
:2 ad copies + 2 visual concepts;
| Campaign Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
:Capture ad copies + visual concepts;

| SDK Calls (Deterministic) |
:Imagen 4: Product ASSET image;
:Imagen 4: Person ASSET image;
:Imagen 4: Trend ASSET image;
:Gecko: Score each image;
| Storage (GCS) |
:Save 3 reference images;

| SDK Calls (Deterministic) |
:Veo 3.1: Commercial with ASSET references;
| Storage (GCS) |
:Save commercial video;

| LLM Agents |
:focus_group_evaluator_agent;
:Analyze commercial + simulate panel;
| Storage (GCS) |
:Save portraits + testimonials;

| Campaign Orchestrator (Deterministic) |
:SAVE_REPORT: Compile branded PDF;
| Storage (GCS) |
:Save Final Report (PDF) + artifact;

stop
